Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.26,0:05:40.70,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}迪拜是{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.70,0:05:42.04,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}印第安维尔斯决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.04,0:05:46.13,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}她{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}赢下萨巴伦卡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.13,0:05:48.68,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}两座都在{\fs78}18{\fs68}岁生日之前
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.68,0:05:51.15,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}这是{\fs78}2009{\fs68}年这个级别设立以来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.15,0:05:53.79,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}最年轻的{\fs78}1000{\fs68}赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.06,0:05:56.99,TL,,0,0,0,,印第安维尔斯决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.99,0:05:58.91,TL,,0,0,0,,记分条写着赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.91,0:06:00.60,TL,,0,0,0,,第一盘她{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}落后
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.60,0:06:03.36,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}已经扳回来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.32,0:06:08.46,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A teenage triumph in tennis paradise.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N网球天堂里 少年夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.76,0:06:10.70,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}还有一条容易漏掉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.70,0:06:11.81,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}不满{\fs78}16{\fs68}岁
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.81,0:06:14.91,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}比赛尽量别排到当地晚上{\fs78}9{\fs68}点以后
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.91,0:06:16.09,TL,,0,0,96,,{\an2}不满{\fs78}18{\fs68}岁
